      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Notas de timing\n\nDriver:\n  await FallingEdge(clk)\n  dut.a.value = txn.a\n  dut.b.value = txn.b\n  await RisingEdge(clk)\n\nMonitors:\n  await RisingEdge(clk)\n  await ReadOnly()",
